<template name="tus_settings_gui_Machinedrum">
<head>
</head>
<body>
	<settingsspacer1/>
	<h1>Firmware</h1>
	<settingsspacer1/>
	<label id="lblFirmwareImage">Running: stock OS</label>
	<settingsspacer1/>
	<div class="settings-storage-actions">
		<button id="btChooseFirmware" class="button">Load Firmware Image...</button>
		<button id="btStockFirmware" class="button">Use Stock OS</button>
	</div>
	<settingsspacer1/>
	<label>An 8 MiB flash image with the stock boot loader: the stock OS or a community OS such as Machinedrum X.13 or the Monomachine EMS firmware (make one from an OS upgrade .syx with tools/elektronOsToFlash.py). Switching restarts the machine from a fresh factory state. The choice becomes the default for new instances and is saved with the project.</label>
	<settingsspacer1/>
	<h1>Panel Rendering</h1>
	<settingsspacer1/>
	<div id="btPixelPerfectPanel" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
		<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
		<label>Crisp LCD and panel lines (experimental)</label>
	</div>
	<settingsspacer1/>
	<label>Use whole-pixel LCD enlargement and align thin panel lines to pixels. Changes immediately; the LCD may appear smaller with more space around it.</label>
	<settingsspacer1/>
	<div id="btLcdRotaryInteraction" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
		<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
		<label>Drag and scroll rotary controls shown on the LCD</label>
	</div>
	<settingsspacer1/>
	<label>Works on synthesis parameters, LFO edit, and Master FX. Menus, tabs, empty cells, and other LCD controls remain inert.</label>

	<settingsspacer1/>
	<h1>Tooltips</h1>
	<settingsspacer1/>
	<div id="btTooltips" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
		<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
		<label>Show tooltips for knobs, LCD fields and the machine name</label>
	</div>
	<settingsspacer1/>
	<label>Pop-up delay: how long the pointer rests on something before its tooltip appears</label>
	<table class="settings-table">
		<tr class="settings-tr">
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btTooltipDelay0" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>Instant</label>
				</div>
			</td>
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btTooltipDelay250" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>0.25 s</label>
				</div>
			</td>
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btTooltipDelay500" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>0.5 s</label>
				</div>
			</td>
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btTooltipDelay1000" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>1 s</label>
				</div>
			</td>
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btTooltipDelay2000" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>2 s</label>
				</div>
			</td>
		</tr>
	</table>

	<settingsspacer1/>
	<h1>Controller</h1>
	<settingsspacer1/>
	<label>The touchpad and the gyro (hold PS and tilt) each turn two knobs. Top and Bottom are the column of the knob the controller has focused. FUNCTION holds FUNCTION while turning; on the Machinedrum that changes the parameter on every track. Absolute makes a touchpad corner or tilt angle set the value; without it, movement nudges the knob.</label>
	<settingsspacer1/>
	<label>Face buttons. By position, the bottom button acts. Nintendo: A (right) acts; pick it for an 8BitDo in X-input mode.</label>
	<table class="settings-table">
		<tr class="settings-tr">
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btPadFaceLayout0" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>Auto</label>
				</div>
			</td>
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btPadFaceLayout1" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>By position</label>
				</div>
			</td>
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btPadFaceLayout2" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>Nintendo</label>
				</div>
			</td>
		</tr>
	</table>
	<settingsspacer1/>
	<label>Touchpad left / right</label>
	<table class="settings-table">
		<tr class="settings-tr">
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btPadTouchXTarget0" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>Top</label>
				</div>
			</td>
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btPadTouchXTarget1" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>Bottom</label>
				</div>
			</td>
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btPadTouchXTarget20" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>LEVEL</label>
				</div>
			</td>
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btPadTouchXTarget99" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>Off</label>
				</div>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr class="settings-tr">
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btPadTouchXTarget10" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>A</label>
				</div>
			</td>
			<td class="settings-td">
